# The disposal parity fixture (see tools/test-protocol-conformance.mjs and
# crates/kerotakis-cli/tests/protocol_conformance.rs). Two hosts run these
# lines and must report the same disposal.
#
# 100 mL of water is 100 g of water, which is why the fixture is written
# this way: the assertions can pin a real number without either host
# having to be asked what it thinks a mole of water weighs.
add v1 water 100mL
discard v1
